WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The customer starts on the product page. They choose a delivery option before adding to cart when the store requires it.

2
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Release candidate labels use Fulfilment, Delivery method, Delivery option, and Estimated delivery. Teach these words — not internal field names.

3
00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:00.000
After adding to cart, the delivery choice should remain. Reload the cart to show that the selection is remembered for the session.

4
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:20.000
At checkout, the customer should see a Delivery charge that matches their selection and destination. Stop before payment. No order creation is required for this video.
